 who had been planning to establish a similar unit, recruited Kusanagi and her team. Together, they begin operations as Public Security Section 9—an offensive tactical unit known as “Shell Squad.” As they confront complex cybercrimes and international conspiracies, the existence of a mysterious, unidentified hacker known as The “Puppet Master” emerges on the horizon of their investigation.\n\nWhat fate awaits Kusanagi? And what is the Puppet Master’s true objective? A new era of cyberpunk action begins.\n\n(Source:攻殻機動隊 THE GHOST IN THE SHELL Site)"},"tags":[{"name":"Cyberpunk","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cyborg","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Robots","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Police","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dystopian","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crime","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bisexual","rank":58,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gender Bending","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anti-Hero","rank":10,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"THE GHOST IN THE SHELL","english":"THE GHOST IN THE SHELL","native":"攻殻機動隊 THE GHOST IN THE SHELL","romaji":"Koukaku Kidoutai: THE GHOST IN THE SHELL","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"攻壳机动队 THE GHOST IN THE SHELL"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"攻壳机动队 2026"}]},"trailer":{"id":"b_v0-RWLo18","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https